WEBVTT

00:12:29.673 --> 00:12:31.663
Krahasuar me te,

00:12:31.663 --> 00:12:35.737
lufta, psikologjikisht, ne disa menyra, ishte e lehte,

00:12:35.737 --> 00:12:38.234
krahasuar me kete lloj tjetersimi.

00:12:38.234 --> 00:12:39.624
Kjo eshte arsyeja pse atyre u mungon lufta,

00:12:39.624 --> 00:12:42.102
dhe kjo eshte ajo cka duhet te kuptojme

00:12:42.102 --> 00:12:45.505
dhe ne nje fare menyre ta rregullojme ne shoqerine tone

00:12:45.505 --> 00:12:48.435
Faleminderit shume.

00:12:48.435 --> 00:12:51.390
(Duartroktije)